 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Cómo se forma",
    "@en": "How it forms"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**aver** o **essere** en infinitivo + participio: **aver capito** (haber entendido), **essere tornato** (haber vuelto).",
     "@en": "**aver** or **essere** in infinitive + partition: **aver capito** (have understood), **essere tornato** (have returned)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Se usa con **dopo**: **Dopo aver capito, ho deciso** (después de haber entendido, decidí).",
     "@en": "It is used with **dopo**: **Dopo aver capito, ho deciso** (after understanding, I decided)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Concordancia",
    "@en": "Conformity"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Con **essere**, el participio concuerda con el sujeto: **dopo essere tornata** (después de haber vuelto, ella). Con **avere** no cambia.",
     "@en": "With **essere**, the participle matches the subject: **dopo essere tornata** (after she has returned, she). **avere** doesn't change."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Así se evita repetir el sujeto.",
     "@en": "This avoids repeating the subject."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "tabla",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Forma",
    "@en": "Form"
   },
